      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "LoveTrain Credits\n\nDeveloped by TEAM MadMole\n\n\nDevelopment\n\nPlanning,
    Game Design\n- \uC774\uC8FC\uC601\n- \uC774\uC0C1\uD604\n\nProgramming\n- \uC774\uC900\uBAA8\n-
    \uC774\uC0C1\uD611\n\nArt\n- \uAE40\uCC2C\uC6B0\n\n\nThird-Party Visual Assets\n\n-
    \"Super Pixel Impact FX Pack 2\" by Will Tice / unTied Games.\n\n\nThird-Party
    Middleware / Plugins\n\n- DOTween Pro by Daniele Giardini / Demigiant.\n- Steamworks.NET
    by Riley Labrecque.\n\n\nSound Effects\n\n- \"285 Game Sound Effects Vol.1\"
    by Filippo Vicarelli / Filippo Game Audio,\n  licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).\n- \"900 Retro Sound Effects!\" by
    brockjroderick.\n- \"8Bit Arcade Game Sound Pack\" by SwissDude.\n- \"8-Bit Sound
    Effects [100+ SFX]\" by Beep Yeah!.\n- \"Retro-stylized Sound Library\" by Helton
    Yan,\n  licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY
    4.0).\n\n\nBackground Music\n\n- \"Slowing mechanical sound\" - generated using
    Suno AI.\n- \"Very slow tempo\" - generated using Suno AI.\n- \"Heavy mechanical
    drum beat\" - generated using Suno AI.\n\nThe listed background music was generated
    by TEAM MadMole using Suno AI\nunder a paid Suno Pro subscription.\n\n\nFonts\n\n-
    DungGeunMo / \uB465\uADFC\uBAA8\uAF34+ Fixedsys by Kil Hyung-jin / Cactus.\n-
    DungGeunMo source credits include the original DungGeunMo work by\n  Kim Jung-tae
    and Fixedsys Excelsior by Darien Gavin Valentine.\n\n\nEngine / Tools\n\n- Unity\n\n\nGenerative
    AI Notice\n\nSome visual concepts, promotional images, text drafts, and background
    music\nwere created or edited with the assistance of generative AI tools. Final\nmaterials
    were reviewed, selected, modified, and integrated by the developer.\n\nThe game
    does not include real-time generative AI features during gameplay.\n\nFull third-party
    license terms and conservative legal notices are provided\nseparately in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.\n"
